{"title":"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By definition, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/4/f0485ec621058d7767291b1b01e7063c5c518a33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r! = r(r - 1) \\cdots 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"136\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/3/da30f0ace8e319f141ded401353dc6ae4c34ace0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{j}{k} = \\frac {j!}{k!(j - k)!}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"140\" height=\"53\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b192eb85ded924ef4d3bb6e3a1f1b6f4a73ed7da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r,j,k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> are positive integers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/d/31d0feb10d5afd577f56dc46ff3dfe2518a98e9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k &lt; j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"18\" />. \nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/3/fd3c2d9ee8883902a0ed638623a7fb860327a3f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{n}{1}, \\binom{n}{2}, \\binom{n}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"129\" height=\"53\" /> form an arithmetic progression with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bd69ad8f022ee1b5894dee7cafb68305b47c9ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> equals \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/8/f28419eaf2a2564dd8fab684e337ed3f2bc5c6e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 5\\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 7\\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 9\\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 11\\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"366\" height=\"17\" />     \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/7/a673cb59b9f1f4b0f822a01b3e1bb7217ac870f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{n}{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"41\" height=\"55\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfc1c8c33b2d04c0d5023f568dc1a07b0bd5f5ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{n}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"35\" height=\"53\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/4/6d41d6d69007b91562901dd96aff7823b71639a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{n}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"35\" height=\"53\" /> form an arithmetic progression, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/a/4aa038d6101b1a966934f0c60c809a7f709ca6c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{n}{2} - \\binom{n}{1} = \\binom{n}{3} - \\binom{n}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"227\" height=\"55\" />.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/2/d72b9f5e53312b284bea18b1b58747374df35903.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{n!}{2!\\cdot(n-2)!}-\\frac{n!}{1!\\cdot(n-1)!}=\\frac{n!}{3!\\cdot(n-3)!}-\\frac{n!}{2!\\cdot(n-2)!}.\\]\" width=\"441\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>Simplifying these expressions yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/e/44e957b3738b4eae393d4d53a4d6cbca128b7dea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n(n-1)}{2}-n = \\frac {n(n-1)(n-2)}{6}-\\frac{n(n-1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"352\" height=\"40\" />. Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and collecting all terms on one side yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/1/75193e7d4125ce05bc61af68b0701efc126a59b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^3 - 9n^2 + 14n = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"155\" height=\"18\" />, which factors to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/8/5586e74db464db6df740518d8dc2efa073236afa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n(n-7)(n-2)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"159\" height=\"20\" />.  The solutions to this equation are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/7/5078041ceb4500dd52823f46781a8312a392d236.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\in \\{0, 2, 7\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"20\" />, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bd69ad8f022ee1b5894dee7cafb68305b47c9ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> so the only valid answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/f/b1f33592d9ff72d3c63b9276f1b711b989b0b6af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\boxed{(\\mathbf{B})\\ 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"92\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~ab2024\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME\" title=\"1982 AHSME\">1982 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1982 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1982\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=198